# The images are built from the repository's root. Only what a Dockerfile copies goes in: the
# rest (the git history, .venv, .realm, the docs) never reaches the build.
*
!src/
# The ocr image installs its runtime client from the lock (services/ocr/Dockerfile).
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
# The api image builds the web app (services/api/Dockerfile, ADR-0010), from its lock.
!web/
web/node_modules
web/dist
